---
<section class="py-20 lg:py-32 bg-neutral-900/50">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-4xl text-center">
    <span class="text-primary font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm mb-4 block">Para quién es Caliber Guard</span>
    
    <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Para coleccionistas que quieren datos, no suposiciones.</h2>
    
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-left mt-12">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-primary/30 transition-colors">
        <div class="text-primary mb-4">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-watch"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/><polyline points="12 10 12 12 13 13"/><path d="m16.13 7.66-.81-4.05a2 2 0 0 0-2-2.33h-2.64a2 2 0 0 0-2 2.33l-.81 4.05"/><path d="m7.88 16.34.81 4.05a2 2 0 0 0 2 2.33h2.64a2 2 0 0 0 2-2.33l.81-4.05"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Colección 10+</h3>
        <p class="text-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Gestiona inventario, wishlist y rotación sin perder el control.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-primary/30 transition-colors">
        <div class="text-primary mb-4">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-bar-chart-3"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M18 17V9"/><path d="M13 17V5"/><path d="M8 17v-3"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Friki de las métricas</h3>
        <p class="text-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Puestas por reloj/día, rankings y stats para decidir qué llevar (y qué no).
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-primary/30 transition-colors">
        <div class="text-primary mb-4">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Privacidad real</h3>
        <p class="text-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Tus datos en tu dispositivo. Sin cuentas obligatorias, sin nube.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
